  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your spells are especially potent, breaking through spell resistance readily.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Wis 13, Knowledge (arcana) 1 rank, ability to cast spells.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Expend your ki focus. You get a +1 bonus on caster level checks or caster power checks made to overcome a creature’s spell resistance per point of ki expended at the time of casting the spell.</p>\n<p>You gain one point of ki.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
